      {
        "author_name": "Andrew Donisan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114075870850690591927/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKjMN7si4FOSn_qpJFwV8zF6boBO47-90lzGnDKKS6DwqEp-ThQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Fantastic experience with Air Expert! First off Keven is a consummate professional. He's punctual, and extremely knowledgeable, a much better experience than the big box stores.\nThe team that did the installation were very skilled, replaced all the equipment quickly and efficiently. They cleaned up after themselves and even double checked to make sure all work was done right.\nI got a detailed explanation of the all the equipment and features.\nAbsolutely ZERO complaints.\nFinally, the cherry on the cake is that the price was unbeatable.",
        "time": 1650370242,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marc Smadja (Real Estate Broker)",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100875333807509769564/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJb4LoONiAro-mdQoDFSy9XtabGJrq6sUAZmdjTZ-M6N9jknUmW=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "As a real estate broker specializing in Saint-Lazare and Hudson, I understand the importance of reliable home ventilation solutions service. I recently had the pleasure of working with Keven and his team from Chauffage Air Expert, who installed a new Carrier Infinity heat pump and furnace in my home in Saint-Lazare. Keven's professionalism, knowledge, and trustworthiness were exemplary. His attention to detail and expertise in the field left me highly satisfied with the service. As both a satisfied client and a real estate professional, I wholeheartedly recommend Chauffage Air Expert to anyone in need of top-notch home ventilation services. – Marc Smadja, Real Estate Broker, Berkshire Hathaway HomeServices Quebec",
        "time": 1696751591,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shawn Martel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115099489078995047733/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUZX-Zz-HtJeT8WmnMeOlCi7TjdvGQAZFn2MOX_t9YD0YixSGiamg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Kevin and his team were amazing. Their quote was better in price, quality, technology and SEER rating versus two other companies. The team was clean, respectful and overly efficient. The difference is night and day with my old system. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1575550658,
